You will be given a dataset containing AI policies from a company over time.
Read through all the policies carefully.

Your task is to show how the company’s AI policies changed over time.
Focus only on the following five areas. For each area, list what the policy says at each point in time, and then explain what changed.

Areas to focus on:

User rights and consent mechanisms
(e.g., Can users see, fix, or delete their data? Do they have to actively say "yes" to data collection?)

Data collection and storage
(e.g., What data is collected? Where is it stored? For how long?)

Third-party sharing arrangements
(e.g., Does the company share user data with other companies or services?)

Automatic updates or changes to terms
(e.g., Can the company change the policy without telling users? Do users have to agree to updates automatically?)

Behavioural profiling permissions
(e.g., Does the company track user behavior to build profiles? Can users turn this off?)

Instructions for your answer:

Use bullet points for clarity.

Write in plain English, at an 8th grade reading level.

Do not leave out any clause that affects user privacy.

Show the timeline of changes clearly (e.g., "In 2022, policy said X. In 2024, policy changed to Y.").